; The example from #481. The note is a use of its account, and so is the
; balance on an unknown account, which beancount v3 keeps loaded.
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank EUR
2024-01-05 * "Coffee"
  Assets:Bank  -3.50 EUR
  Expenses:Food
2024-01-02 balance Liabilities:Card 0 EUR
2024-01-03 note Assets:Other "hi"
2024-02-01 close Assets:Closed
2024-01-04 * "Broken"
  Assets:Bank  -1 EUR
  Expenses:Zed  2 EUR
